# Raw model answers quote course material (slides, staff names and emails).
# Kept local; results-grades.json and heldout-grades.json (written
# automatically by ask_modes_eval.py, stripped to metrics only — see
# GRADES_FIELDS in the script) are what's shared.
*.json
!*-grades.json

# Quiz audit: items and the grading sheet quote course text. Counts (quiz-audit-grades.json) are shared.
quiz-audit-sheet.csv
quiz-audit-key.csv
benchmark-key.md

# Judge hand-check: sheet quotes course text; key reveals the judge's grades until you have graded blind.
judge-check-sheet.md
judge-check-key.csv
